<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-LEADING RESULTS FROM ST LOUIS 300 CART RACE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LEADING RESULTS FROM ST LOUIS 300 CART RACE.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Illinois 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results from</p>
<p>Saturday's St Louis 300 CART Race:</p>
<p>1. Paul Tracy (Canada) Penske Mercedes-Benz, 236 laps</p>
<p>completed, average speed 113.884 mph/183.227 kph</p>
<p>2. Patrick Carpentier (Canada) Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 236</p>
<p>laps</p>
<p>3. Gil de Ferran (Brazil) Reynard Honda, 236</p>
<p>4. Alex Zanardi (Italy) Reynard Honda, 236</p>
<p>5. Jimmy Vasser (U.S.) Reynard Honda, 236</p>
<p>6. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil) Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 236</p>
<p>7. Parker Johnstone (U.S.) Reynard Honda, 236</p>
<p>8. Adrian Fernandez (Mexico) Lola Honda, 236</p>
<p>9. Richie Hearn (U.S.) Lola Ford, 236</p>
<p>10. Andre Ribeiro (Brazil) Lola Honda, 236</p>
<p>Series championship standings leaders after Saturday's</p>
<p>race -- sixth stop on the 17-race CART circuit:</p>
<p>   1. Paul Tracy (Canada)	   85 points</p>
<p>   2. Alessandro Zanardi (Italy)  67</p>
<p>   3. Scott Pruett (U.S.)	   61</p>
<p>   4. Michael Andretti (U.S.)     54</p>
<p>   5. Greg Moore (Canada)	   44</p>
<p>Next round: June 1 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin</p>
</text>
